---
const sectors = [
  { title: '手机 / PC / 服务器', value: '~$2T', desc: '数字生活与企业 IT 的基础设施' },
  { title: '汽车 / 新能源', value: '~$3T', desc: '电动化、智能驾驶与功率器件' },
  { title: '云计算 / AI 服务', value: '~$500B+', desc: '训练、推理、网络与数据中心' },
  { title: '家电 / IoT / 工业', value: '~$3T', desc: '看不见但无处不在的控制芯片' },
];
---

<section class="not-prose my-8 rounded-3xl border border-cyan-400/20 bg-slate-950 p-5 text-white shadow-2xl shadow-cyan-950/30 sm:p-6">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-cyan-300">Economic Leverage</p>
      <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black">半导体本身不大，但撬动整个数字经济</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-300/20 bg-white/5 px-4 py-3 text-right">
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">全球半导体市场</p>
      <p class="text-3xl font-black text-cyan-200">~$630B</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr]">
    <div class="relative min-h-64 rounded-3xl border border-cyan-300/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500/15 via-slate-900 to-emerald-500/15 p-5">
      <div class="absolute inset-6 rounded-full border border-cyan-300/15"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-14 rounded-full border border-emerald-300/15"></div>
      <div class="relative flex h-full min-h-56 items-center justify-center">
        <div class="rounded-full border border-cyan-200/30 bg-cyan-300/15 px-8 py-7 text-center shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(34,211,238,0.22)]">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan-200">Semiconductor</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black">芯片</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">算力、传感、控制、存储</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {sectors.map((sector) => (
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] p-4">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <h4 class="font-bold">{sector.title}</h4>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-300/15 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-emerald-200">{sector.value}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">{sector.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-amber-300/20 bg-amber-300/10 p-4">
    <p class="font-bold text-amber-100">认知点：芯片像电力，不是终端产品，却决定终端产品能不能存在。</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">所以半导体的产值看起来只是几千亿美元，但它撬动的是手机、汽车、AI、工业与国防这些更大的系统。</p>
  </div>
</section>
